# 不应被跟踪（历史上一度入库，内容长期滞后于源码）。需要时本地重新构建即可。
**/dist-verify/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
.playwright-cli/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/playwright/.auth/
**/.runtime/

